  "question": {
    "text": "What will be the stress at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> , if a steel rod with a cross-sectional area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mi>mm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is stretched between two fixed points? The tensile load at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5000</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. (Assume <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11.7</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> )"
  },
